  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given an array AAA, consisting of NNN **distinct** integers.\n\nCalculate number of pairs (i,j)(i,j)(i,j) (1≤i&lt;j≤N)(1 \\le i &lt; j \\le N)(1≤i&lt;j≤N), such that 2⋅(Ai⊕Aj)=Ai+Aj2 \\cdot (A_i \\oplus A_j) = A_i + A_j2⋅(Ai​⊕Aj​)=Ai​+Aj​, where ⊕\\oplus⊕ denotes bitwise XOR.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line contains two integers NNN −-− the size of the array.\nThe second line contains NNN space-separated integers A1,…,ANA_1, \\ldots, A_NA1​,…,AN​ −-− the elements of the array AAA.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output the number of pairs satisfying constraints.",
    "constraints": [
      "2≤N≤1062 \\leq N \\leq 10^62≤N≤106",
      "1≤Ai≤260−11 \\leq A_i \\leq 2^{60}-11≤Ai​≤260−1",
      "Subtasks",
      "**Subtask 111 (20 points):** 2≤N≤20002 \\leq N \\leq 20002≤N≤2000",
      "**Subtask 222 (40 points):** 1≤Ai≤220−11 \\leq A_i \\leq 2^{20}-11≤Ai​≤220−1",
      "**Subtask 333 (40 points):** Original constraints."
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "4\n1 2 3 6",
        "output": "2",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nThere are 222 pairs (i,j)(i,j)(i,j) satisfying all the conditions.\n\n(i,j)=(1,3)(i,j)= (1, 3)(i,j)=(1,3). Thus, 2⋅(A1⊕A3)=2⋅(1⊕3)=2⋅2=42\\cdot (A_1\\oplus A_3) = 2\\cdot (1\\oplus 3) = 2\\cdot 2 = 42⋅(A1​⊕A3​)=2⋅(1⊕3)=2⋅2=4. Also, A1+A3=1+3=4A_1+A_3 = 1+3 = 4A1​+A3​=1+3=4.\n(i,j)=(2,4)(i,j)= (2, 4)(i,j)=(2,4). Thus, 2⋅(A2⊕A4)=2⋅(2⊕6)=2⋅4=82\\cdot (A_2\\oplus A_4) = 2\\cdot (2\\oplus 6) = 2\\cdot 4 = 82⋅(A2​⊕A4​)=2⋅(2⊕6)=2⋅4=8. Also, A2+A4=2+6=8A_2+A_4 = 2+6 = 8A2​+A4​=2+6=8."
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_2",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "5\n4 3 9 7 1",
        "output": "1",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nThere is only one pair (i,j)(i,j)(i,j) satisfying all the conditions:\n\n(i,j)=(2,5)(i,j) = (2, 5)(i,j)=(2,5). Thus, 2⋅(A2⊕A5)=2⋅(3⊕1)=2⋅2=42\\cdot (A_2\\oplus A_5) = 2\\cdot (3\\oplus 1) = 2\\cdot 2 = 42⋅(A2​⊕A5​)=2⋅(3⊕1)=2⋅2=4. Also, A2+A5=3+1=4A_2+A_5 = 3+1 = 4A2​+A5​=3+1=4."
      }
    ]
  },
